WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:05,720
It's almost twelve o'clock

2
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:15,460
Why are there so many people awake?

3
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:26,590
Gotta leave something behind, girl

4
00:00:26,590 --> 00:00:36,870
You are too courageous

5
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:37,870
Why did you come back so late?

6
00:00:37,870 --> 00:00:38,870
No need, no need

7
00:00:38,870 --> 00:00:39,870
I can move it myself

8
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:40,870
You, a girl, carry so much stuff

9
00:00:40,870 --> 00:00:41,870
Not afraid of being robbed

10
00:00:41,870 --> 00:00:42,870
We're on our way back

11
00:00:42,870 --> 00:00:43,870
I saw two groups of people with my own eyes

12
00:00:43,870 --> 00:00:44,870
Fighting over supplies

13
00:00:44,870 --> 00:00:45,870
If it weren't for Yuanzhi's quick reaction,

14
00:00:45,870 --> 00:00:46,870
Nothing on our ship can be saved.

15
00:00:47,870 --> 00:00:54,540
I was planning to stay at a relative's house.

16
00:00:54,540 --> 00:00:56,540
But then it rained harder and harder

17
00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:57,540
My parents are not in good health

18
00:00:57,540 --> 00:00:58,540
I'm not worried

19
00:00:58,540 --> 00:00:59,540
Even the night came back
